im  you know he's hooking the captain of  he's hooking the captain of the  opposition team one minute and he's  hugging saka the next minute with  compassion  and that's what a great leader has done  and gary southgate over this last three  to four years not just three to four  years throughout his life actually  has carried himself brilliantly as an  individual and it demonstrates that you  can be a gentleman you can have really  good standards  but you can also lead  gary i know you feel very passionate  about that what's  next for this england team it's the  world cup next year  can we go one better  geosomething after last tournament i i  said i hope these lads get the  opportunity to experience  the semi-final opportunity again to get  to a final  they actually got there and in the back  of mind i always worried that that might  be the best chance against croatia in  russia  in 2018 but they've got there again they  proved us all wrong again  in the sense of what england teams can  do because i always think you get to a  semi-final then you can gary we're  running out of time  but i think yes they can we'll see you  soon

